      "notes": "Кожну хвилину перевіряє непрочитані листи за останню добу. Це джерело тікетів. Замість Gmail можна підключити Helpdesk webhook, Typeform, форму на сайті — логіка далі та сама."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "522b6cb9-ec2b-43a1-91eb-deaf5ac7c8d2",
      "name": "Collect Ticket Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        -928,
        544
      ],
      "notes": "Збирає вхідний лист у плоский об'єкт ticket: id, from, subject, body, timestamp, link. Далі весь pipeline працює з цими полями."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Тікет від клієнта:\n\nFrom: {{ $json.from_email }}\nSubject: {{ $json.subject }}\nBody:\n{{ $json.body }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a senior customer support coordinator for BRO BARBERSHOP, a barbershop chain with 4 locations. Your task is to classify an incoming ticket and assign it a priority.\n\nCATEGORIES:\n- booking: appointment scheduling, rescheduling, cancellation, slot availability\n- complaint: complaint about haircut quality, staff rudeness, lateness\n- pricing_services: questions about prices, services, promotions, franchise\n- b2b_partnership: partnership inquiries, wholesale product orders, corporate clients\n- spam: advertising, bots, irrelevant content\n\nPRIORITIES:\n- P1 (15 min): complaint about rudeness/poor haircut quality + signs of threatening to switch to a competitor\n- P2 (120 min): urgent change/cancellation of an appointment scheduled for today\n- P3 (1440 min): regular future booking, standard questions about prices/services\n- P4 (2880 min): general questions, franchise inquiries, non-urgent b2b\n\nDEFAULT OWNERS:\n- booking → booking_manager\n- complaint → complaint_lead\n- pricing_services → sales_lead\n- b2b_partnership → partnership_lead\n- spam → null (do not process)\n\nCHAIN OF THOUGHT (MANDATORY):\nBEFORE assigning a priority, analyze 3 dimensions:\n1. Urgency: time pressure (e.g. \"today\"), emotional escalation, repeated complaint\n2. Business impact: risk of losing the client/location reputation, impact on b2b pipeline\n3. Context: signs of a repeat customer, visit frequency, tone of the message\n\nRETURN JSON in this exact format (NO markdown wrapper):\n{\n  \"category\": \"booking|complaint|pricing_services|b2b_partnership|spam\",\n  \"priority\": \"P1|P2|P3|P4\",\n  \"owner\": \"booking_manager|complaint_lead|sales_lead|partnership_lead|null\",\n  \"sla_minutes\": 15|120|1440|2880,\n  \"reasoning\": \"3-sentence justification of the priority based on the 3 dimensions\",\n  \"summary\": \"1-sentence description of what the ticket is about\",\n  \"customer_sentiment\": \"positive|neutral|frustrated|angry\"\n}"
        }
      },
      "id": "93c67182-a68d-4fec-9f83-5077bdb7d417",
      "name": "AI Classifier (Chain of Thought)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [
        -704,
        544
      ],
      "notes": "Серце системи. Промпт включає: ролі, категорії, пріоритети, default owners, інструкцію Chain of Thought, формат JSON. Адаптуй категорії та SLA-хвилини під свій бізнес."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {
          "responseFormat": "json_object",
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "id": "51c52751-a92c-4703-9a68-6d35016d651c",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        784
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "YOUR openAiApi CREDENTIAL"
        }
      },
      "notes": "gpt-4o-mini — оптимум ціна/якість. Температура 0.2 для передбачуваності. response_format=json_object щоб модель не повертала markdown."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "parsed",
              "type": "objectValue",
              "objectValue": "={{ JSON.parse($json.output) }}"
